t health  benefits you can keep you regular help  lower your cholesterol control your  blood sugar and even can help you  maintain a healthy weight men need  around 38 grams a day and women around  25 grams so some of these easy swaps are  a great way to meet your target now it's  time for my healthy holiday apple and  pumpkin crisps for the filling I mix  together two peeled diced apples one cup  of pumpkin puree three tablespoons of  dried cranberries a tablespoon of minced  candied ginger 2 teaspoons of  whole-grain flour one and a half  tablespoons of maple syrup 2 teaspoons  of melted butter quarter teaspoon of  cinnamon and a generous pinch of salt  working now on the crisp topping I  combined two tablespoons each of rolled  oats whole grain flour and brown sugar 3  tablespoons of chopped pecans quarter  teaspoon of cinnamon 2 teaspoons of  ground flax seed a quarter cup of melted  butter and 1/2 a cup of all brand buzz  trust me  you're not gonna be picking out  leftovers after you eat this so I  transfer the filling to two oven-safe  ramekins and finish it off with the  crumble topping bake at 375 degrees for  25 to 30 minutes and enjoy  see healthy eating at the holidays  doesn't have to mean giving up on all  your family's face just a few simple  high-fiber cereal swaps and you'll be on  your way to the new year resolution free  thanks so much for watching guys more  great healthy holiday ideas be sure to  subscribe to my channel and I'll see you  next time on hobbies kitchen
 

